    'Candle or wax melt': '蜡烛或香薰蜡片', 'Glass candle jar or aluminum tin with lid, label and box': '带盖、标签和纸盒的玻璃蜡烛罐或铝罐', 'Fill temperature, vessel and lid fit, wax contact, wick clearance, decoration and packed protection.': '灌装温度、罐体与盖子配合、蜡接触、烛芯间隙、装饰及成品包装保护。', 'Reed diffuser': '无火香薰扩香', 'Glass bottle with stopper, cap or collar, reeds and carton': '带塞子、盖子或套环、香薰藤条和纸套的玻璃瓶', 'Neck fit, evaporation use case, formula contact, leak orientation, reed dimensions and secondary packing.': '瓶口配合、挥发使用场景、配方接触、防漏摆放、藤条尺寸及二次包装。', 'Room spray or body mist': '室内喷雾或身体喷雾', 'Glass or plastic bottle with fine-mist pump and cap': '带细雾泵头和盖子的玻璃或塑料瓶', 'Formula contact, pump priming, spray output, dip-tube length, leakage and decoration near the neck.': '配方接触、泵头启动、喷雾输出、吸管长度、泄漏及瓶口附近的装饰。', 'Spa or hotel amenity set': 'SPA 或酒店用品套装', 'Mini bottles, jars, pouches, pumps, caps and coordinated kit pack': '迷你瓶、罐、袋、泵头、盖子和配套套装包装', 'Viscosity, target dose, fill line, kit assembly, label area, replenishment and carton count.': '黏度、目标剂量、灌装线、套装组装、标签区域、补充流程和每箱数量。',
