    'Plan an amenity program around use and replenishment': '围绕使用和补充规划酒店用品项目', 'Choose mini bottles, pouches or refillable dispensers by guest-use format, formula viscosity, hygiene and replenishment process, branding, carton count and destination requirements. An amenity set is complete only when the container, closure, filled formula, packing and refill action are reviewed together.': '根据客用格式、配方黏度、卫生与补充流程、品牌、箱数和目的地要求选择迷你瓶、袋装或可补充分配器。只有容器、封口、灌装配方、包装和补充动作一起审核，用品套装才算完整。', 'Hospitality packaging routes and the questions to confirm before sampling': '酒店用品包装路线及打样前需要确认的问题', 'Program': '项目', 'Guest-room mini set': '客房迷你套装', 'Mini bottles or jars with pump, flip cap or screw cap': '带泵头、翻盖或螺旋盖的迷你瓶或罐', 'Formula viscosity, fill volume, cap retention, label area, leakage, guest-use ergonomics and carton count.': '配方黏度、灌装体积、盖子保持力、标签区域、泄漏、客用 ergonomics 和每箱数量。', 'Spa or travel kit': 'SPA 或旅行套装', 'Sample jars, sachets, pouches, sleeves and small bottles': '试用罐、袋装、软袋、纸套和小瓶', 'Number of uses, seal integrity, kit assembly, artwork, pouch dimensions and packed distribution.': '使用次数、封口完整性、套装组装、设计稿、软袋尺寸和包装配送。', 'Refill hospitality program': '酒店补充装项目', 'Refill pouch with reusable bottle, dispenser, pump or spout cap': '配合可重复使用瓶、分配器、泵头或嘴盖的补充软袋', 'Spout fit, transfer control, cleaning or replacement instructions, replenishment workflow and empty-pack handling.': '嘴部配合、转移控制、清洁或更换说明、补充流程及空包装处理。', 'Distributor or multi-property rollout': '经销商或多物业推广', 'Matched component family with labels, cartons and export dividers': '配套组件系列、标签、纸箱和出口隔板', 'SKU list, component continuity, barcode or label space, master-carton quantity, destination and reorder control.': 'SKU 清单、组件连续性、条码或标签空间、主箱数量、目的地和复购控制。', 'For a useful quote, send the property or program type, products, fill volume, closure, branding, quantity per SKU, replenishment model, destination and timing. Compare the': '如需有效报价，请提供物业或项目类型、产品、灌装量、封口、品牌要求、每个 SKU 数量、补充模式、目的地和时间，再对比', 'refill-versus-mini guide': '补充装与迷你装指南', 'home fragrance and spa packaging': '家居香氛与 SPA 包装', 'travel-size leak-testing guide': '旅行装防漏测试指南', 'before sample approval.': '再确认样品。', 'Hotel amenity packaging route comparison': '酒店用品包装路线对比',
    'Approval path': '确认路径', 'Approve the beverage bottle as a filled system': '将饮料瓶作为灌装系统确认', 'Choose a beverage bottle from the drink, target fill volume, filling process and closure before comparing shape or unit price. Carbonated, hot-filled, pasteurized and reusable programs need project-specific bottle drawings, closure matching and physical samples; a catalog image does not establish pressure, thermal or line suitability.': '先根据饮料、目标灌装量、灌装工艺和封口选择饮料瓶，再比较外形或单价。含气、热灌装、巴氏杀菌和可重复使用项目需要项目专用瓶图、匹配封口和实物样品；目录图片不能证明耐压、耐温或产线适配性。', '1. Freeze the brief': '1. 固定需求简报', 'Record beverage, capacity, glass or PET route, fill temperature, carbonation or pressure, closure, decoration, quantity and destination.': '记录饮料、容量、玻璃或 PET 路线、灌装温度、含气或压力、封口、装饰、数量和目的地。', '2. Match the closure': '2. 匹配封口', 'Review neck finish, cork, crown, ROPP, screw, lug or swing-top assembly with liner, gasket, tamper feature and capping equipment.': '核对瓶口、木塞、皇冠盖、ROPP、螺旋盖、凸耳盖或 swing-top 组件，以及内垫、密封圈、防拆结构和封盖设备。', '3. Approve production-intent parts': '3. 确认生产意图组件', 'Check bottle dimensions, capacity, filled behavior, closure fit, decoration, export dividers and the packed route before bulk production.': '批量生产前检查瓶尺寸、容量、灌装后表现、封口配合、装饰、出口隔板和包装运输路线。', 'For a decision-ready inquiry, include the beverage, capacity, closure, filling conditions, quantity, destination, decoration and reference drawing. Continue with the': '如需可直接决策的询价，请提供饮料、容量、封口、灌装条件、数量、目的地、装饰和参考图纸，再查看', 'neck-finish guide': '瓶口规格指南', 'glass shipping guide': '玻璃运输指南',
    'Approve the nail bottle, brush and formula as one set': '将甲油瓶、刷子和配方作为一套确认', 'A nail polish bottle is a dispensing system, not only a glass container. Match the bottle, neck, wiper, brush, stem, cap, formula viscosity, fill process, light exposure, decoration and sealing behavior before approving a private-label component.': '甲油瓶是一个分配系统，不只是玻璃容器。确认私牌组件前，要匹配瓶体、瓶口、刮片、刷子、刷杆、盖子、配方黏度、灌装工艺、光照、装饰和密封表现。', 'Nail-care packaging routes and the questions to confirm before sampling': '美甲包装路线及打样前需要确认的问题', 'Formula or use': '配方或用途', 'Route to compare': '对比路线', 'Clear or pigmented lacquer': '透明或有色甲油', 'Clear, colored or square glass bottle with brush cap': '透明、有色或方形玻璃瓶配刷盖', 'Neck and wiper fit, brush pickup and payoff, stem length, fill level, evaporation, cap torque and decoration.': '瓶口与刮片配合、刷子取液与释放、刷杆长度、液位、挥发、盖子扭矩和装饰。', 'UV-sensitive gel polish': 'UV 敏感型甲油胶', 'Opaque black or light-managed glass bottle with brush system': '不透明黑色或控光玻璃瓶配刷子系统', 'Required light-management evidence, formula contact, brush output, closure seal, fill process and artwork durability.': '所需控光证据、配方接触、刷子输出、封口密封、灌装工艺和设计稿耐久性。', 'Base coat, top coat or treatment': '底油、亮油或护理液', 'Matched bottle, brush and cap family for repeat SKUs': '适用于重复 SKU 的配套瓶、刷和盖系列', 'Viscosity range, brush consistency, component codes, label panel, color matching and reorder continuity.': '黏度范围、刷子一致性、组件编码、标签面、颜色匹配和持续复购。', 'Cuticle oil or travel set': '指缘油或旅行套装', 'Pen, mini bottle or discovery format with applicator': '带涂抹器的笔式、迷你瓶或体验装', 'Applicator dose, leakage, cap retention, formula compatibility, kit assembly and packed orientation.': '涂抹器剂量、泄漏、盖子保持力、配方兼容性、套装组装和包装方向。', 'For a comparable RFQ, share the formula type, capacity, bottle shape, brush and cap, decoration, quantity per SKU, destination, timeline and reference sample. Use the': '如需可比询价，请提供配方类型、容量、瓶型、刷子和盖子、装饰、每个 SKU 数量、目的地、时间表和参考样品，使用', 'makeup packaging hub': '彩妆包装中心', 'glass cosmetic bottle guide': '玻璃化妆品瓶指南', 'compatibility testing guide': '兼容性测试指南', 'to prepare the brief.': '准备需求简报。', 'Nail polish packaging route comparison': '甲油包装路线对比'
